  "id": "point-scale",
  "term": "point scale",
  "definition": "A point scale is a rating method that assigns responses to ordered numerical categories, such as a 5-point scale used to score satisfaction. In this context, it means expressing a judgment or experience as one of a small set of ranked points so results can be compared or analyzed.",
